  "details": "When you click a world and get its information what shows up is the icon,  the world author and what description they have put for there world.\nI feel that adding the last update date would help a lot. A lot of people have worlds they would like to revisit when they are updated but unless they are in a discord or see a tweet or notice a file size change there is no other indication of when a world was last updated unless the world author puts it in the description.   This would help a lot of people to decide if there favourate worlds have been updated and to revisit them.",
